      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792704165285,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How Catalogue publishes to Kinesis #1 (CDC with Debezium, an outbox table, or a direct publish) and who sends the SNS invalidation are not described.\nThe consumer writing DynamoDB and then publishing 'invalidate' is the obvious way to wire it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How Catalogue publishes to Kinesis #1 (CDC with Debezium, an outbox table, or a direct publish) and who sends the SNS invalidation are not described.\nThe consumer writing DynamoDB and then publishing 'invalidate' is the obvious way to wire it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
